; Import library definition for the kernel32 entry points HYPRLODR uses.
; Converted to a .lib by llvm-dlltool in tools/build_windows.sh.
LIBRARY KERNEL32.dll
EXPORTS
CreateDirectoryA
CreateFileA
CreateThread
CreateToolhelp32Snapshot
DisableThreadLibraryCalls
FindClose
FindFirstFileA
FindNextFileA
FreeLibrary
GetCommandLineA
GetCurrentProcessId
GetProcessHeap
GetModuleFileNameA
GetModuleHandleA
GetProcAddress
GetStdHandle
HeapAlloc
HeapFree
HeapReAlloc
LoadLibraryA
Module32First
Module32Next
MultiByteToWideChar
ReadFile
WideCharToMultiByte
VirtualProtect
SetUnhandledExceptionFilter
Sleep
WriteFile
CloseHandle
